## Feedback bot template — English.
fb-greeting =
    👋 Hi! Send me your message — text, photo, voice, anything — and I'll pass it on.
    You'll get the answer right here.
fb-owner-home =
    📬 <b>This is your feedback bot.</b>

    Share <code>{ $link }</code>. Every message people send arrives here; <b>reply</b> to it to answer them.
    • /admin — settings (greeting, away mode…), stats and broadcasts
    • /ban (as a reply) — stop someone from writing
    • Add me to a group and send /setinbox there to answer as a team
fb-owner-hint = ↩️ To answer someone, <b>reply</b> to their message.
fb-delivered = ✅ Sent! You'll get the answer here.
fb-away = ✅ Sent! We're away right now and will answer as soon as we're back.
fb-unavailable = 😕 Couldn't deliver your message right now. Please try again later.
fb-reply-sent = ✅ Delivered.
fb-reply-unknown = 🤔 I don't know who sent that message.
fb-reply-failed = ⚠️ Couldn't deliver: { $error }
fb-user-blocked = 🚫 This person stopped the bot.
fb-ban-usage = Reply to a message with /ban, or /ban <user id>.
fb-banned = 🚫 User { $id } can no longer write to this bot.
fb-unbanned = ✅ User { $id } can write again.
fb-inbox-group = 👥 Messages now arrive in this group. Anyone here can answer by replying.
fb-inbox-private = 👤 Messages arrive in your private chat again.
fb-btn-own = 🤖 Create your own bot
